   "text": "Security checks (free, before any AI call)\n- Sender is exactly @ucsd.edu\n- Gmail confirms it's not forged (dmarc=pass)\n- Inbox only: Gmail's spam filter goes first\n- Max 3 replies per sender per day\n- Long emails cut short",
   "originalText": "Security checks (free, before any AI call)\n- Sender is exactly @ucsd.edu\n- Gmail confirms it's not forged (dmarc=pass)\n- Inbox only: Gmail's spam filter goes first\n- Max 3 replies per sender per day\n- Long emails cut short",
